<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LEASING FEB PROFIT 6.3 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LEASING FEB PROFIT 6.3 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank said on Friday that its leasing subsidiary made an unaudited profit of 6.3 million kroons in February and a net profit of 10.7 million kroons in the first two months of the year.</p>
<p>The balance sheet of Hansa Leasing grew by 14.2 percent and was 1.45 billion kroons at the end of last month, Hansapank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
